[12px] text-white/25\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-1-3\" data-name=\"chevron-down expand icon\"></i>\n</button>\n<ul class=\"mt-0.5 space-y-px\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2\" data-name=\"Payments nav link list\">\n<li data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"nav list item container\">\n<a class=\"flex h-8 items-center gap-2.5 rounded-md px-2 text-[13px] text-white/80 hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Fees and Payments nav link\" href=\"/student-fees\">\n<i class=\"icon-credit-card text-[16px] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"credit card icon\"></i>\n<span class=\"flex-1 truncate\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Fees and Payments nav label\">Fees &amp; Payments</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shrink-0 border-t border-white/[0.06] p-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4\" data-name=\"sidebar footer profile block\">\n<a class=\"flex h-8 items-center gap-2.5 rounded-md px-2 text-[12.5px] text-white/55 hover:bg-white/[0.05] hover:text-white/85\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"My Profile nav link\" href=\"/student-profile\">\n<i class=\"icon-user-round text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"user outline icon\"></i>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"My Profile link label\">My Profile</span>\n</a>\n<div class=\"mt-1 flex h-11 items-center gap-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.04] px-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"user profile card\">\n<span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--indigo-strong)] text-[10px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"user initials avatar circle\">AM</span>\n<span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"user name and class info block\">\n<span class=\"block truncate text-[12.5px] font-medium leading-4 text-white/90\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"student name text\">Aarav Menon</span>\n<span class=\"mt-[2px] block truncate text-[10.5px] leading-3 text-white/40\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"student class and roll id text\">VIII-A, roll 24-081</span>\n</span>\n<i class=\"icon-chevrons-up-down text-[13px] text-white/30\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"chevrons up-down selector icon\"></i>\n</div>\n<a class=\"mt-1 flex h-8 items-center gap-2.5 rounded-md px-2 text-[12.5px] text-white/55 hover:bg-white/[0.05] hover:text-white/85\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3\" data-name=\"Sign out link\" href=\"/login\">\n<i class=\"icon-log-out text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"log out icon\"></i>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-2\" data-name=\"Sign out link label\">Sign out</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main content column\">\n<header class=\"flex h-14 shrink-0 items-center gap-3 border-b border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--card)] px-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"top header bar\">\n<i class=\"icon-panel-left text-[16px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"panel-left sidebar toggle icon\"></i>\n<span class=\"h-5 w-px bg-[var(--border)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"header divider line\"></span>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12.5px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"breadcrumb navigation\">\n<span class=\"text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"breadcrumb root label\">Radora</span>\n<span class=\"text-[var(--border)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"breadcrumb separator slash\">/</span>\n<span class=\"font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"breadcrumb current page label\">Homework</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"header right actions cluster\">\n<div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"header search field container\">\n<i class=\"icon-search pointer-events-none absolute left-2.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[14px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"search magnifier icon\">